  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container info-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>What to feature here</h2>
      <ul class="inline-list">
        <li>Healing service replays</li>
        <li>Scripture-based teaching on healing</li>
        <li>Testimony highlights</li>
